# Write the firmware's motion mode (firmware CMD_SET_MOTION_MODE).
#
# The current firmware recognises mode 0 only, which is the same thing as park(): a
# declared static hold at full stiffness. The SDK rejects other values loudly instead of
# ACKing a mode change that does not happen. Use park() when that is what you mean.

int32 mode
---
bool success
string message
